 Of Active Photo Captures And Real-Time IR Night Vision Use, While Recharging Quickly Via Any Standard Type-C USB Charging Port.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q4":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How Is This Binocular Assembly Safer For A Child's Optical Health Compared To Old Glass Optics?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Traditional Optical Binoculars Force Young Kids To Keep Their Eyes Tightly Squinted Against Dual Viewfinder Lens Caps, Frequently Leading To Headaches. This Smart System Moves Visual Play Straight Onto An Expanded Eye-Friendly Open IPS Shield Surface, Preserving Clear Fields Of Vision Safely.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q5":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can Children See Birds, Animals And Distant Objects Clearly?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Absolutely. The Powerful 10X Optical Zoom Combined With 3X Digital Zoom Allows Children To Observe Birds, Wildlife, Trees, Buildings And Other Faraway Objects In Greater Detail.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q6":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is It Difficult For Kids To Use?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Not At All. The Binoculars Are Designed Specifically For Children With Simple Controls, Lightweight Construction And An Easy-To-Use Interface That Makes Exploring Fun And Hassle-Free.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_q1","collapsible_row_q2","collapsible_row_q3","collapsible_row_q4","collapsible_row_q5","collapsible_row_q6"],"custom_css":[".collapsible-content-wrapper-narrow {max-width: 100.4rem;}",".collapsible-none-layout details.accordion__details {background: #c7a3d1; color: #fff;}",".accordion .material-symbols-outlined {color: #fff;}",".accordion__title {color: #fff;}",".accordion.animate-item.animate-item--child.accordion--medium.accordion--top-border {margin-bottom: 15px;}",".accordion__details {padding: 0 10px;}"],"settings":{"display_id":false,"vis